      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The Belgium Interdisciplinary Working group on Acute Cardiology, including cardiologists, intensivists and urgentists was formed to provide consensus regarding the management of acute chest pain in the prehospital and the early hospital phase. General recommendations and critical pathways are proposed to improve the treatment of the patients with acute coronary syndromes."},
